<title>GERMANY: Egypt's Mubarak to meet Germany's Kohl on May 20.</title>
<headline>Egypt's Mubarak to meet Germany's Kohl on May 20.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian President Hosni Mubarak is to visit Bonn on May 20 for talks with German Chancellor Helmut Kohl and President Roman Herzog, the German government said on Friday.</p>
<p>The statement did not give further details about the visit or what the leaders would discuss.</p>
